rrior's Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warrior_s_Shield_a2adb9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Necklace%20of%20the%20Deep\"><img alt=\"Necklace of the Deep\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Necklace_of_the_Deep_e307e3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Trident\"><img alt=\"Heavy Trident\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Heavy_Trident_008e83.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ancient Ancestorial Grounds 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"102\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Ancestorial_Grounds_1_b28fa0.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ancient Ancestorial Grounds 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"90\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Ancestorial_Grounds_2_74c388.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.80.7048<br/>July 3, 2018<br/>Summer Update 2018</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Ancient Ancestorial Grounds</b> is a sacred site of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeplings\">Deeplings</a> which is under attack by their enemies, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Deathlings\">Deathlings</a>. \n</p><p>It's a good hunting place for teams or Druids + Knights duo, yielding both good experience and enough loot to pay all supplies. Even though the creatures here do not drop any very valuable item, they drop Warrior's Axes and Shields very often. All the loot obtained here can be sold nearby to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rock%20in%20a%20Hard%20Place\">Rock In A Hard Place</a>, which is also very convenient. The spawn is big enough in a way that two separate teams can hunt at the same time, one on each floor (it's possible to levitate down from the first to the second floor on the spots marked on the map). \n</p><p>To reach this place, go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33514,31323,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this hole (33514, 31323, 7)</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a>, then go down several steps of stairs and go two floors up to the east, until you find a teleport <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33584,31388,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33584, 31388, 13)</a>.\n</p><p>Access to this place is obtained through <a href=\"#/quest/the-secret-library-quest\">The Secret Library Quest</a> which partially takes place here.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Warrior\"><img alt=\"Deepling Warrior\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deepling_Warrior_cfbcd9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Warrior\">Deepling Warrior</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,600</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">550 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>2-180× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (always)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Warts\">Deepling Warts</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deeptags (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Ridge (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Filet (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>0-5× Vortex Bolt (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\">Fish Fin</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Trident\">Heavy Trident</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Eye of a Deepling (rare)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Axe (rare)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Shield (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deathling%20Scout\"><img alt=\"Deathling Scout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deathling_Scout_d744c7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Deathling%20Scout\">Deathling Scout</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1250</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-25× Crystalline Arrow (common)</li>\n<li>1-25× Vortex Bolt (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-12× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Warts\">Deepling Warts</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Enchanted%20Sapphire\">Small Enchanted Sapphire</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Filet (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deeptags (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Ridge (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Trident\">Heavy Trident</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Eye of a Deepling (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Axe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\">Fish Fin</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necklace%20of%20the%20Deep\">Necklace of the Deep</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deathling%20Spellsinger\"><img alt=\"Deathling Spellsinger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deathling_Spellsinger_bb0f2b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Deathling%20Spellsinger\">Deathling Spellsinger</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">6,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1300+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-14× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-25× Crystalline Arrow (common)</li>\n<li>1-14× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Filet (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deeptags (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Deepling Ridge (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Warts\">Deepling Warts</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-25× Vortex Bolt (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Eye of a Deepling (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Trident\">Heavy Trident</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Axe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Warrior's Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\">Fish Fin</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\">Life Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Enchanted%20Sapphire\">Small Enchanted Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necklace%20of%20the%20Deep\">Necklace of the Deep</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["the-secret-library-quest"]}